#!args --dxf :fixture --no-gpu
# G6e2 without a device (--no-gpu sets jfgui_GPU=0: the view paints through the CPU path): the same script as dxf_view.uis,
# the same places and colours.  The drawing of --test dxf shown whole (0.234 units a pixel, the middle at (15.5, 40)): the
# green solid hatch at x 563, y 425, the cyan SOLID at x 358, y 475, the blue 3DFACE at x 392.  A drag with the middle
# button pans, the wheel zooms at the pointer (the hatch under it stays, hovered: orange over green), a click picks it
# (selected: blue over green, the pointer away), Esc clears
wait 600
expect pixel 563 425 #00FF00
expect pixel 358 475 #00FFFF
expect pixel 392 475 #0000FF
drag 300,300 350,300 middle
wait 200
expect pixel 613 425 #00FF00
expect pixel 408 475 #00FFFF
wheel 613,425 120
wait 200
expect pixel 613 425 #DF9A17
click 613,425
wait 200
move 700,60
wait 200
expect pixel 613 425 #178BBF
key esc
wait 200
expect pixel 613 425 #00FF00
